{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_BC003B42","title":"Third Meeting with Salma","entry":"Dlg_BC003B42::entry","exit":"Dlg_BC003B42::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_81D875BF","articyId":"72057611217951669","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"I keep seeing you around.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I keep seeing you around.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":375.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"47116","byteOffset":32158648,"byteLength":372}},{"id":"DFr_7A88C641","articyId":"72057611217951683","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"That’s true. I think I’ve been to every Ramen place a dozen times.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That’s true. I think I’ve been to every Ramen place a dozen times.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":975.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"29998","byteOffset":19228568,"byteLength":380}},{"id":"DFr_13CD84F6","articyId":"72057611217951697","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"My brother liked it really. Eating it always reminds me of him.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"My brother liked it really. Eating it always reminds me of him.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1575.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36430","byteOffset":28126784,"byteLength":408}},{"id":"DFr_AE97A159","articyId":"72057611217951718","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"But he loved Ramen, so I eat it as much as I can. In case one day I look over the bowl and see him sitting there.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"But he loved Ramen, so I eat it as much as I can. In case one day I look over the bowl and see him sitting there.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":2475.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"36126","byteOffset":28014704,"byteLength":460}},{"id":"DFr_DA222B5A","articyId":"72057611217951744","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"Seth.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Seth.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":1,"name":"Neutral"},"position":{"x":3075.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37932","byteOffset":28685176,"byteLength":316}},{"id":"DFr_5C9B2FE3","articyId":"72057611217951758","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"Maybe. But it's all I've got.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Maybe. But it's all I've got.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":3075.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"28640","byteOffset":18719568,"byteLength":340}},{"id":"DFr_B19853B9","articyId":"72057611217951773","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"Fifteen years ago.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Fifteen years ago.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3675.0,"y":425.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31734","byteOffset":19886584,"byteLength":364}},{"id":"DFr_19BF7FFB","articyId":"72057611217951794","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"It’s taken a lot just to get this far. I think I know what I’m doing. Goodbye.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It’s taken a lot just to get this far. I think I know what I’m doing. Goodbye.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":4575.0,"y":300.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"51951","byteOffset":34068776,"byteLength":392}},{"id":"DFr_0002432A","articyId":"72057611217951801","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"A bit like me. But it’s been so many years. I might have sat down next to him at a counter and ordered Tsukemen Ramen and never known.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"A bit like me. But it’s been so many years. I might have sat down next to him at a counter and ordered Tsukemen Ramen and never known.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":4275.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40633","byteOffset":29700368,"byteLength":444}},{"id":"DFr_56FEC1DC","articyId":"72057611217951815","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"I’ve changed too. And this city has a way of making people forget.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"I’ve changed too. And this city has a way of making people forget.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":4875.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"42059","byteOffset":30238024,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_DD687071","articyId":"72057611217951846","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"Thanks. It’s been nice to talk.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Thanks. It’s been nice to talk.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":5775.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"44087","byteOffset":31013696,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_D694073F","articyId":"72057821671309606","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"No, surely not. No offense meant.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"No, surely not. No offense meant.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":975.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"31622","byteOffset":19844248,"byteLength":344}},{"id":"DFr_0A946A3E","articyId":"72057821671309628","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"He vanished, as if the city just swallowed him up.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"He vanished, as if the city just swallowed him up.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":2175.0,"y":550.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"39056","byteOffset":29108520,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_D54FFE49","articyId":"72057821671309644","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Salma Smith","text":"There's a Ramen stand in Mountain Town. There's a good chance to meet me there.","speakerId":"Ntt_A7B3062F","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVe